# Overview

The Authentication + Role-Based Entry foundation has been implemented,
compiled successfully, and browser-verified.

This milestone connects the existing CascadEffects product experiences to
authenticated application identity and persisted platform / organization
membership and role context.

The implementation does not rebuild Builder, Runtime, Administration, or the
Member Workspace.

The established flow is:

```text
Login
  ↓
Supabase Auth
  ↓
Application User
  ↓
Platform / Organization Membership
  ↓
Role Context
  ↓
Current Entry Context
  ↓
Role-Based Entry
  ↓
Existing Product Experience
```

The three supported entry actors remain:

- Platform Super Admin
- Organization Admin
- Member

Authentication establishes identity.

Production authorization remains a separate security milestone.

