# Known Entry Architecture Limitation

A user may belong to multiple Organizations.

The current entry-resolution implementation can select an applicable
Organization using the existing membership ordering behavior.

This is not the final multi-tenant entry experience.

The next milestone is explicit multi-Organization entry selection.

The intended direction to evaluate is:

```text
/entry
  ↓
Platform Super Admin?
  ├── YES → Super Admin
  └── NO
       ↓
Organization Membership Count
       ↓
  ┌────┴────┐
  ↓         ↓
 One       Many
  ↓         ↓
Role Entry  Organization Selector
                ↓
        Server-side validation
                ↓
             Role Entry
```

This behavior must be confirmed architecturally before implementation.

The selected Organization must remain context only.

It must not become the authorization boundary.

